  "decisionHub": {
    "whatItIs": "Shore is appointment scheduling and local business management for salons, studios, and service businesses — online calendar, website/Google/Instagram booking, reminders, customer management, and marketing tools on higher tiers. US pricing (2026-08-19): Booking $59.90/mo or $49.90/mo billed annually; Booking + Marketing $79.90/$69.90 annual. 14-day free trial, no commission on bookings. POS is primarily DACH (Germany, Austria, Switzerland). Scored in the live-chat-support cluster as customer-facing booking/conversation entry — not a website messenger like Tidio.",
